<%= title("Verify your current email address") %>
<%= spacer() %>
<%= row do %>
  A change to your Operately email was requested. The proposed new address is <strong><%= @destination %></strong>.
<% end %>
<%= spacer() %>
<%= row do %>
  Enter this code in Operately to verify your current inbox. It expires in 5 minutes.
<% end %>
<%= spacer() %>
<tr style="height: 80px; font-size: 40px; font-family: monospace;"><td><%= @code %></td></tr>
<%= spacer() %>
<%= row do %>
  We’ll then send a separate code to the new address. Your email won’t change until both inboxes are verified.
  If you didn’t request this change, ignore this email. Don’t share this code with anyone.
<% end %>
